  "prefLabel": "Puc 2202.15 Utility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2202.15 “Utility” means any electric generation, transmission, or distribution company meeting the definition of a public utility under RSA 362:2 and RSA 362:4-a and includes rural electric cooperatives.\n\nSource. #13457, eff 10-12-22",
